WEBVTT

NOTE Generated by scripts/captions-guide.py - do not edit by hand.

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.790
This is Tho.

2
00:00:00.790 --> 00:00:06.255
It helps you find barbers and salons near
you in Thimphu, see what each one offers,

3
00:00:06.255 --> 00:00:09.157
and book a time — all from your phone.

4
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.977
Sign in with your email and password.

5
00:00:13.977 --> 00:00:18.469
If you would rather look around first,
choose Browse without an account —

6
00:00:18.469 --> 00:00:23.423
you only need one when you want to
book, join a queue, or message a salon.

7
00:00:25.900 --> 00:00:29.448
Creating an account takes a
name, an email and a password.

8
00:00:29.448 --> 00:00:32.385
Choose Customer if you
are booking appointments,

9
00:00:32.385 --> 00:00:35.232
or Business if you run a salon yourself.

10
00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:39.801
If you try to message or book while
browsing, Tho asks you to finish signing up —

11
00:00:39.801 --> 00:00:43.289
and everything you saved while
looking around comes with you.

12
00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:45.834
Discover is your home screen.

13
00:00:45.834 --> 00:00:51.233
It opens with the salons you have booked
before, whatever offers are running,

14
00:00:51.233 --> 00:00:56.331
and services grouped by type —
hair, barber, spa, nails and makeup.

15
00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:03.370
Tap the search icon and start typing to
go straight to a salon you already know.

16
00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:08.601
The filter narrows the list by who
the salon serves, the kind of service,

17
00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:12.400
its rating, how far away it
is, and what you want to spend.

18
00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:14.410
Apply to see the results.

19
00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:18.024
The Map tab puts those same
salons where they actually are,

20
00:01:18.024 --> 00:01:21.654
so you can choose one by how
close it is rather than by name.

21
00:01:22.200 --> 00:01:27.245
A salon's page carries its rating and
today's opening hours, buttons to message,

22
00:01:27.245 --> 00:01:31.912
call or get directions, whether you
can walk in right now, and its photos.

23
00:01:31.912 --> 00:01:34.456
Book Appointment starts a booking.

24
00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:37.652
The Services tab lists
everything this salon does,

25
00:01:37.652 --> 00:01:40.145
each with how long it
takes and what it costs —

26
00:01:40.145 --> 00:01:43.539
a beard trim at twenty minutes
and a hundred and fifty ngultrum,

27
00:01:43.539 --> 00:01:47.440
a haircut and style at thirty
minutes and three hundred and fifty.

28
00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:53.449
Specialists shows who works
there and who you can book with.

29
00:01:53.449 --> 00:01:58.463
Below it sits the salon's loyalty card,
and how close you are to a free visit.

30
00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.903
Booking runs in three steps.

31
00:02:00.903 --> 00:02:02.738
First choose your services.

32
00:02:02.738 --> 00:02:04.505
You can add more than one,

33
00:02:04.505 --> 00:02:09.119
as long as a single stylist can
do them all in the same visit.

34
00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:13.891
With your services and your stylist
settled, pick a day and an open time.

35
00:02:13.891 --> 00:02:16.360
The button carries the time and the price,

36
00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:19.405
so you know exactly what
you are agreeing to.

37
00:02:19.900 --> 00:02:24.170
Before you confirm you can add a
style, a note, or a reference photo,

38
00:02:24.170 --> 00:02:26.707
so your stylist knows what you are after.

39
00:02:26.707 --> 00:02:29.891
Cancelling is free up
to twelve hours before.

40
00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.395
And that is it.

41
00:02:31.395 --> 00:02:35.243
Your appointment is confirmed,
with the date, the service,

42
00:02:35.243 --> 00:02:38.496
your stylist and the
salon all on one card.

43
00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:42.779
If a salon takes walk-ins, you
can join its queue from here.

44
00:02:42.779 --> 00:02:46.872
Choose a barber and a service,
and Tho tells you where you stand.

45
00:02:46.872 --> 00:02:51.933
It notifies you when you are next, so
you do not have to wait at the shop.

46
00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:57.504
My bookings keeps your
appointments in three tabs.

47
00:02:57.504 --> 00:03:02.409
Each upcoming card carries its reference
and its price, a switch for reminders,

48
00:03:02.409 --> 00:03:05.416
and buttons to cancel or open the receipt.

49
00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:10.038
Once a visit is done
it moves to Completed,

50
00:03:10.038 --> 00:03:13.818
where you can leave the salon a
review or pull the receipt up again.

51
00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:18.194
Chats keeps one conversation with
each salon you have contacted.

52
00:03:18.700 --> 00:03:21.848
Ask whether they are open, or
whether there is a slot today —

53
00:03:21.848 --> 00:03:25.551
there are quick replies ready for
the questions people ask most.

54
00:03:26.100 --> 00:03:30.327
Notifications gathers your confirmations
and cancellations, the offers running,

55
00:03:30.327 --> 00:03:34.151
the points you earn, and word
that an order is ready to collect.

56
00:03:34.700 --> 00:03:36.614
Salons can sell products too.

57
00:03:36.614 --> 00:03:42.227
The Shop tab lists what this one keeps
in stock, and Add puts it into an order.

58
00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:48.990
Switching Discover over to Products
browses everything on sale across salons,

59
00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:52.732
by category, with what is new
and what is selling this week.

60
00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:55.885
A product page gives you
the price, what it is for,

61
00:03:55.885 --> 00:03:58.601
and which salon you
would be buying it from.

62
00:03:59.100 --> 00:04:00.891
My orders follows each one through,

63
00:04:00.891 --> 00:04:03.849
and you pay cash at the
salon when you collect it.

64
00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:08.375
My rewards keeps the points you
have collected, salon by salon.

65
00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:11.205
Saved salons is everywhere
you tapped the heart,

66
00:04:11.205 --> 00:04:13.574
ready for the next time you want to book.

67
00:04:14.100 --> 00:04:18.589
The menu gathers the rest — your
profile, your saved salons, your orders,

68
00:04:18.589 --> 00:04:20.896
your rewards and your settings.

69
00:04:21.400 --> 00:04:25.916
Your profile holds your name and your
photo, and links out to your messages,

70
00:04:25.916 --> 00:04:29.882
your saved salons, your rewards,
your packs and your orders.

71
00:04:30.400 --> 00:04:34.045
Settings covers your appointment
reminders and the privacy policy.

72
00:04:34.045 --> 00:04:35.537
And if you ever want to go,

73
00:04:35.537 --> 00:04:39.858
Delete account removes your sign-in
and your personal details for good.
